Parameteries Constructor:
Example:
   class Student {
    int id;
    String name;

    // Parameterized Constructor
    Student(int i, String n) {
        id = i;
        name = n;
    }

    void display() {
        System.out.println("ID = " + id);
        System.out.println("Name = " + name);
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Student s1 = new Student(101, "Rakib");
        Student s2 = new Student(102, "Rahim");

        s1.display();
        s2.display();
    }
}

Copy Constructor:
Example:
   class Book {
